## 5. Open questions for the human

All resolved during Phase 1 (see "Phase 1 outcome" below):

1. **Sitemap/RSS deps** - RESOLVED. Used official integrations `@astrojs/sitemap`
   + `@astrojs/rss` (per the human's tip to leverage official extensions when
   justified). Both build clean and are base-path correct.
2. **Dark mode default** - PENDING (Phase 2). Will implement: follow system
   `prefers-color-scheme` with a manual toggle persisted in `localStorage`.
3. **Search** - DEFERRED to Phase 4 (only if content grows).
4. **Analytics** - NONE for now.
5. **Scope** - Phases 1-3 confirmed as this round; Phase 4 selective.

---

## 6. Phase 1 outcome (SEO & site essentials)

Implemented and verified (`npm run build` passes, 51 pages, 0 errors/warnings):

- **robots.txt** - dynamic `src/pages/robots.txt.ts` endpoint; `Sitemap:`
  directive uses `withBase('/sitemap-index.xml')` so the base path is preserved
  (a bare relative ref dropped it - fixed).
- **Canonical URLs** - `<link rel="canonical">` in `Layout.astro`, computed via
  `abs(stripBase(Astro.url.pathname))` so it is correct under a sub-path deploy.
- **Custom 404** - `src/pages/404.astro`; excluded from the sitemap via the
  integration `filter`.
- **Sitemap** - `@astrojs/sitemap` integration; `i18n` option groups en/zh into
  `<xhtml:link rel="alternate" hreflang>` entries. Correct base URLs.
- **RSS** - `@astrojs/rss`; `/rss.xml` (en) + `/zh/rss.xml` (zh), 20-item cap,
  locale-aware links. Feed-discovery `<link>` added to `Layout.astro`.

New deps: `@astrojs/sitemap`, `@astrojs/rss` (both official, low risk).
New files: `src/pages/robots.txt.ts`, `src/pages/rss.xml.ts`,
`src/pages/zh/rss.xml.ts`, `src/pages/404.astro`, `src/lib/feed.ts`.

Pre-existing, unrelated: 4 `ts(6133)` hints (unused `withBase` import in the
4 docs route files). Left untouched to keep this phase focused; can be cleaned in
a separate trivial PR.

Next: Phase 2 (Reading UX) - dark mode, heading anchor IDs, TOC, copy-code,
prev/next.
